{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1793758828219, "sessionID": "ses_e5ba4ab79ffeQxkC2p1VOIeNdp", "part": {"id": "prt_1a45b7fff001co5aRMaBIIQb7q", "messageID": "msg_1a45b78cf001Zh8k3NMCp991bo", "sessionID": "ses_e5ba4ab79ffeQxkC2p1VOIeNdp", "type": "text", "text": "**ReportingService directly depends on BillingService and OrderService.** Its full dependency tree, down to the databases, is:\n\n```text\nReportingService\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 BillingService\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 STORES \u2192 BillingPostgresDatabase\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 CALLS \u2192 NotificationsAPI\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 OrderService\n\u2502       \u251c\u2500\u2500 STORES \u2192 OrdersPostgresDatabase\n\u2502       \u251c\u2500\u2500 CALLS \u2192 PaymentsAPI\n\u2502       \u2514\u2500\u2500 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n\u2502           \u2514\u2500\u2500 STORES \u2192 UsersPostgresDatabase\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 OrderService\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 STORES \u2192 OrdersPostgresDatabase\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 CALLS \u2192 PaymentsAPI\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n        \u2514\u2500\u2500 STORES \u2192 UsersPostgresDatabase\n```\n\nAcross those paths, ReportingService depends on **three services**, **two APIs**, and **three databases**:\n\n| Type | Dependencies |\n|---|---|\n| Services | BillingService, OrderService, UserService |\n| APIs | NotificationsAPI, PaymentsAPI |\n| Databases | BillingPostgresDatabase, OrdersPostgresDatabase, UsersPostgresDatabase |\n\nNo configuration keys were returned by the dependency traversal.", "time": {"start": 1793758822399, "end": 1793758828214}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_034e812e34d2278f016aea9666561087d0a184c0ad7ca8e526", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
